Immich Cinema
=============

Immich Cinema is a modified fork of Immich-Android-TV
(https://github.com/giejay/Immich-Android-TV), an unofficial Android TV client for the
Immich self-hosted photo server.

Modified on 2026-10-18:
  - Rebranded to "Immich Cinema"; changed the application id (Kotlin package unchanged).
  - Removed Firebase Analytics and Crashlytics.
  - Removed the in-app donation flow (Play Billing).
  - Removed the QR "sign in by phone" flow.

Immich Cinema is unofficial and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the
Immich project (https://github.com/immich-app/immich) or its developers. The name
"Immich" is used descriptively to indicate compatibility with the Immich server.

